## Canonical public / runtime-safe environment values
## Safe to commit. Do NOT put secrets here (no DATABASE_URL, SESSION_SECRET, *_SECRET, bearer tokens).
## Load order: `.env.public` then `.env` (server, Vite, drizzle-kit).

# =============================================================================
# OAUTH — client IDs only (never put client secrets here)
# =============================================================================
